# 🏥 Hospital Appointment Analysis Dashboard

An end-to-end data visualization and analysis dashboard built in **Power BI** to track hospital appointment trends, analyze patient attendance patterns, and improve clinical operational efficiency.

---

## 📊 Key Insights & Features

- **Appointment Attendance Rates:** Visualizes Show vs. No-Show rates across different departments and timeframes.
- **Demographic Analysis:** Examines patient distribution by age, gender, and underlying medical conditions.
- **Wait Time & Scheduling Trends:** Identifies peak appointment hours and lead-time impacts on cancellation rates.
- **Interactive KPI Cards:** Tracks total appointments, completion rates, and lost revenue from missed appointments.

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies Used

- **Microsoft Power BI Desktop:** Dashboard design, DAX measures, and visual analytics.
- **Power Query:** Data cleaning, transformation, and modeling.
- **Data Source:** Hospital appointment dataset (`.csv` / `.xlsx`).

